drm/panel: add Samsung S6D05A1 DPI panel driver (Tianma TM025ZDZ01, Nest J49)

320x320 round-bezel module: S6D05A1 controller on McSPI1 (9-bit SPI, mode 3),
pixels over 24-bit DPI from the OMAP3 DSS. Init sequence and timings from the
stock 2.6.37 panel-tianma-tm025zdz01.c (MADCTL 0xd0 = rotated 180). Optional
backlight phandle (drm_panel_of_backlight).

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: J49 project <j49@users.noreply.github.com>

--- a/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Kconfig	2026-10-28 20:56:33.741712738 +0100
+++ b/drivers/gpu/drm/panel/Kconfig	2026-10-28 20:53:27.493645296 +0100
@@ -303,6 +303,14 @@
 	depends on BACKLIGHT_CLASS_DEVICE
 	select VIDEOMODE_HELPERS
 
